TIL that "log" has more meanings than (1) a piece of wood or (2) some sort of periodic data recording, be it a ship's log or a server log. In this case it's short for "logarithmic profile" (
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Log_profile
).

Or as the go proverb goes "a little copying is better than a little dependency" (
https://go-proverbs.github.io/
)
